==Nihil walkers==
===Storm walker===
{{Main|Storm walker}}
The [[storm walker]] was a model of walker used by the [[Nihil]] [[Pirate|marauders]] during the [[High Republic Era]].<ref name="All">{{StoryCite|story=All the Republic|book=Revelations (2023) 1}}</ref>

<gallery>
File:StormWalker-AllTheRepublic.png|A Nihil storm walker
</gallery>

==Mechs==
[[File:OpenMight-ObiWanAnakin4.jpg||thumb|right|180px|Mechs of the Open]]
{{Main|Mech}}
[[Mech]]s were a type of walker that served as war machines for the [[Open]] faction during the [[Open-Closed War|Open-Closed war]]. Equipped with gatling gun [[slugthrower]]s, the mechs of the [[planet]] [[Carnelion IV]] were put to effective use during the [[mission to Carnelion IV]] in [[29 BBY]] by the leader of the Open, [[Mother (title)|Mother]] [[Pran]].<ref name="Anakin 5">[[Obi-Wan and Anakin 5|''Obi-Wan and Anakin'' 5]]</ref>

==''Terrapin''-class Bulk Tanker==
[[File:Turtletanker_relationship.png|thumb|right|180px|''Terrapin''-class Bulk Tanker]]
{{Main|TR-RL3 Terrapin-class bulk tanker}}
The [[TR-RL3 Terrapin-class bulk tanker|''Terrapin''-class Bulk Tanker]], a utilitarian craft used to assist landing on planets with minimal or no docking facilities, was a hybrid [[starship]] and walker vehicle.<ref name="Turtle Tanker">{{Databank|turtle-tanker|Turtle Tanker}}</ref>

==Separatist Walkers==
===Harvester===
{{Main|Harvester (Confederacy of Independent Systems)}}
The [[Harvester (Confederacy of Independent Systems)|Harvester]] was four-legged [[Battle droid|battle]] [[droid]] used by the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]]. It was notably used to [[Mining|mine]] the [[Plant|flora]] of [[Hissrich]].<ref name="Mace Windu 3">[[Jedi of the Republic – Mace Windu 3|''Jedi of the Republic – Mace Windu'' 3]]</ref>

===LM-432 crab droid===
{{Main|LM-432 crab droid}}
The LM-432 crab droid, commonly referred to as simply the '''crab droid''', was a four-[[Limb|legged]] [[droid]] [[walker]] of varying size manufactured by the [[Techno Union]].<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star wars]]''</ref>

===OG-9 Homing Spider Droid===
{{Main|OG-9 homing spider droid}}
The [[OG-9 homing spider droid]], a four-legged battle droid manufactured by [[Baktoid Armor Workshop]], was notably used by the Confederacy of Independent Systems during the Clone Wars.<ref name="OG-9 Homing Spider Droid">{{Databank|homing-spider-droid|Homing Spider Droid}}</ref>

===Octuptarra tri-droid===
{{Main|Octuptarra tri-droid}}
The [[Octuptarra tri-droid]] was a model of three-[[Limb|legged]] heavy assault droid walker designed by the [[Techno Union]] for the Confederacy of Independent Systems during the Clone Wars, and participated in major battles such as the [[Battle of Christophsis]] and the [[Battle of Utapau]].

