==Rebel walkers==
===Enhanced AT-AP===
{{Main|Enhanced AT-AP walker}}
The Enhanced All Terrain Attack Pod was a variant of the AT-AP with twin cannons used by the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]].<ref name="Commander" />

===Versatile-Athletic Walker===
{{Main|Versatile-Athletic Walker}}
The Versatile-Athletic Walker (VAW), nicknamed the "'''zalaaca walker'''" after the [[species]] of the [[Zalaaca|same name]], was an experimental personal [[scout]] walker used by Alliance to Restore the Republic.<ref name="Forged in Battle">''[[Forged in Battle]]''</ref>

==Mobile loading gantry==
{{Main|Mobile loading gantry|Heavy industrial crane transport}}
In use in [[the galaxy]]<ref name="Chapter 11">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 11: The Heiress}}</ref><ref name="Chapter 15">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 15: The Believer}}</ref> by [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|11|the appearances of [[mobile loading gantry]]s crane's appearance}}</ref> the mobile loading gantry was a type of walker used as a crane. The [[heavy industrial crane transport|heavy industrial crane transport (HI-CT)]] was used on the [[water]] [[moon]] of [[Trask]],<ref name="Chapter 11" /> while [[Mobile loading gantry|another similar model]] was used by the [[New Republic]] in the [[Karthon Chop Fields]].<ref name="Chapter 15" />

